{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"agent_message","text":"# Implementation Notes\n\n## Decisions Made\n- Bootstrapped a four-crate Cargo workspace: `tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, and `tank_scenarios`.\n- Implemented the Milestone 1 core surface in `tank_core`: domain types, derived geometry/snapshot math, typed action validation, deterministic `SimRng` over `ChaCha8Rng`, JSON save/load, invariant enforcement, and a minimal queued-action engine.\n- Made RNG save/load deterministic by serializing seed plus draw count and reconstructing the `ChaCha8Rng` state on deserialize.\n- Added TOML preset scaffolding in `tank_data` and created all required preset files.\n- Added milestone tests for save/load roundtrip, determinism, action validation, and queue ordering.\n\n## Spec Deviations\n- `TankGeometry` includes an extra `lid_exchange_factor` field so closed-top tanks can carry the required configurable default factor of `0.25`.\n- `WaterChangePercent` currently performs proportional dilution in the minimal engine and validates the source profile ID, but it does not yet mix against loaded source-water chemistry. Full source-water mixing is deferred to the next milestone.\n- `tank_tui` and `tank_scenarios` are scaffold crates only in this pass; they compile and depend on the right crates but do not implement full product behavior yet.\n\n## Testing\n- Ran formatting: `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc nixpkgs#rustfmt -c cargo fmt --all`\n- Ran verification: `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc -c cargo test`\n- All workspace tests passed, including `save_load_roundtrip`, `determinism_basic`, `action_validation`, and `action_queuing`.\n\n---"}}
